; 3_mml_example_d - Korobeiniki, the harmony line under the FM lead
; @f3 starts the FM Korobeiniki at the same 144 BPM; this voice walks the
; bass underneath and both loop over the same sixteen bars.

T144
@p1
@f3
V9
O2
L8

; A: two bars each of E minor, A minor, E minor, A minor - twice
E B E B E B E B  E B E B E B E B
A > E < A > E < A > E < A > E  A > E < A > E < A > E < A > E
E B E B E B E B  E B E B E B E B
A > E < A > E < A > E < A > E  A > E < A > E < A > E < A > E

; B: one chord a bar - Em C D B7, Em C D E(B7)
E B E B E B E B  C G C G C G C G
D A D A D A D A  B > F+ < B > F+ < B > F+ < B > F+
E B E B E B E B  C G C G C G C G
D A D A D A D A  E B E B G+ B G+ B

~
